{"parse": {"title": "NWE-05", "pageid": 69809, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/NWE-04\" title=\"NWE-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">NWE-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/NWE-06\" title=\"NWE-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">NWE</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.8C.AE.E4.BA.88.E4.BA.BA.E7.9A.84.E8.8A.B1.E6.9D.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"献予人的花束\">献予人的花束</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 献予人的花束</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Funeral</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>说<span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>手<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>空<span class=\"color-value\"></span>空<span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>也<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>谁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>看<span class=\"color-value\"></span>见<span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>捧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>着<span class=\"color-value\"></span>些<span class=\"color-value\"></span>什<span class=\"color-value\"></span>么<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191805</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:150%\">两天后</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxin\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>喂……小梅斯梅尔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门上响起急不可耐的敲击声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>我听说你们有一架旧式循环机废弃了！快让我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-506601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-506601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-506601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯康复中心职员：</div><div>小梅斯梅尔女士不在办公室，她今天休假了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>哈？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>兔毛手袋抓挠着头发，这是比重塑之手占领拉普拉斯科算中心还要匪夷所思的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>休假？那个小梅斯梅尔？你确定没在糊弄我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-506601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-506601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-506601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉普拉斯康复中心职员：</div><div>我们没有必要这样做……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>算了，我之后会再回来一趟的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2f/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"453\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"180\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门外不痛快的脚步，慢慢远去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她听若未闻，继续在待销毁的档案箱里翻找着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拾起里面的软盘，它作为人工梦游仪器最初的备份，用以实验对大脑记忆的储存技术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>软盘上贴着泛黄的标签，上面写着——“多萝西娅”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>看来这就是你想让我看见的东西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁贴黏附到头上，她躺卧下来，合上眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是她第一次为自己启动人工梦游。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\">“软盘读取中，请紧闭双眼，并注意切勿中途切断。”</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:116%\">“读取成功。”</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-shuixiamaopao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"shuixiamaopao\"><img alt=\"shuixiamaopao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/600px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/900px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fc/Cg-shuixiamaopao.png/1200px-Cg-shuixiamaopao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“滴、滴、滴——”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chaerdunjia.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chaerdunjia\"><img alt=\"chaerdunjia\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-chaerdunjia.png/600px-Cg-chaerdunjia.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-chaerdunjia.png/900px-Cg-chaerdunjia.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-chaerdunjia.png/1200px-Cg-chaerdunjia.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>哈哈，生日快乐，多萝西娅！许个愿吧，让我瞧瞧我们的天才长大后想干出些什么成就～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-621320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-621320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-621320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>唔……我许愿，未来请让我当个运动员，或者宇航员……如果可以，我还要去异国他乡旅行，成为环游世界的冒险家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-621320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-621320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-621320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>噢，对了！还有、还有！我还想要一匹小马，一只能装下鲸鱼的泳池……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蜡烛燃烧着，她吐露着心愿，直到大人们都面露难色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>连小狗都在桌底下焦急地打转。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>嘿，亲爱的……我们先停一停好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-621320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-621320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-621320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>不，不，我还没说完呢！在买下一座游乐园后，我希望给全世界的孩子都放一个长假，这样我们就可以……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人苦笑着，拍拍妻子的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">父亲：</div><div>让多萝西娅说吧，我想我们的天才应该攒了一肚子的愿望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而她始终站在远处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……你有很多不切实际的幻想，多萝西娅。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-tiantai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"tiantai\"><img alt=\"tiantai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-tiantai.png/600px-Cg-tiantai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-tiantai.png/900px-Cg-tiantai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-tiantai.png/1200px-Cg-tiantai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>不，不，姐姐，那不是你的错……你已经做了所有你能做的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>失魂落魄的女人蹲坐在地上，曾经洁白的护士服沾满了灰土。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">姐姐：</div><div>你不明白，多萝西娅……我已经撑不住了，我再也不敢看向那些孩子渴盼的眼睛了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">姐姐：</div><div>我怎么能不颤抖，怎么能一次又一次对他们说谎，说一切都会好起来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">姐姐：</div><div>昨天，我又把一颗石子丢进了那个沙坑里，但你知道吗？它被弹了出来，就像是一辆公交车满员了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">姐姐：</div><div>那些力所不及的事令我崩溃，我不能……无法再承担期待了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/HeadIconSmall-612401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">姐姐：</div><div>我会回家修养一段时间……也许干些别的，你知道——那些离我爱的人更近一些的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩抱住了她的头，分担着她身体里的那份颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"621601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"621601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-621601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-621601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>不管如何，我就在你身后，姐姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>多萝西娅抱住姐姐，攒紧了手中的医学院徽章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像小梅斯梅尔见过的所有辞别的职员，这份退缩不是什么稀奇事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……逃兵。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxueshiyanshi\"><img alt=\"daxueshiyanshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png/600px-Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png/900px-Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png/1200px-Cg-daxueshiyanshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-563901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-563901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-563901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>……如果静脉注射每60毫升40毫克的多巴胺溶液，要想让速率维持在合适的范围，那么静脉注射速度的设置——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/07/HeadIconSmall-563913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>拉普拉斯科算中心……等着我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她全神贯注，入迷地阅读着那些密密麻麻的书籍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>周围已空无一人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电话留言：</div><div>嘿，孩子你还好吗？你的舅舅本杰明打算在明天结婚，希望你能来。你老爸快要被你的留言信箱气死了，快回他电话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电话留言：</div><div>我……是在医院实习的马克，记得吗？是你留给我的号码。我看见了一家不错的餐厅，如果你有空，我是说你有兴趣的话——请给我回电。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">电话留言：</div><div>哔——哔——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>书籍竖起高墙，将一则则留言隔绝，直至响起结束的句点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……这就是分岔路了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>下一个。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuekeshi\"><img alt=\"daxuekeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/600px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/900px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/1200px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuezoulang\"><img alt=\"daxuezoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/600px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/900px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Cg-daxuezoulang.png/1200px-Cg-daxuezoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuetushuguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuetushuguan\"><img alt=\"daxuetushuguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-daxuetushuguan.png/600px-Cg-daxuetushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-daxuetushuguan.png/900px-Cg-daxuetushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/Cg-daxuetushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-daxuetushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshihunan\"><img alt=\"bangongshihunan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/600px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/900px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Cg-bangongshihunan.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshihunan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-tiantai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"tiantai\"><img alt=\"tiantai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-tiantai.png/600px-Cg-tiantai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-tiantai.png/900px-Cg-tiantai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-tiantai.png/1200px-Cg-tiantai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看见她毕业在一个隆冬，嬉笑闹腾的学生们，拍了齐齐的合照。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看见她因为身上的烟味被护士长揪住了把柄，咒骂着写了报告书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看见她第一次宣告了家属已死亡，即便努力克制，她还是躲进了厕所里，哽咽不止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一次家庭旅行，一场舞会，葬礼与祷告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挣扎与享乐，麻醉与除颤器……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……我已经觉得这只是浪费我们的时间了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>好了，多萝西娅，就到这里吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的手贴近额头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接下来她只要轻轻按住磁贴，这场梦游便宣告结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>漆黑中，远处正有一个人矗立。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但人影没有靠近，亦没有远离，只是站在那儿，就像一座冬日的雕塑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">多萝西娅：</div><div>你长高了，小梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她知道自己的手打颤了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但仅仅是一瞬间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>再见。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2f/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"453\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"180\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>很遗憾，这是我们最后一次见面了，多萝西娅——根据流程，接下来我们将会销毁这些废旧资料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>把软盘丢回了箱子，她抬起手，看了看时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>比我预估的多花了3分04秒……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>尚在可控范围。如果准时，梅斯梅尔家族的代理人还有三小时四分才到达……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她起身，整理衣装，接着合上了门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像离开一场事不关己的葬礼。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "NWE-05"}}